<!-- Kristin's own icon (backspace.svg, 25x19 viewBox): an outlined backspace key
     with an X inside, shown in the composer while the picker drawer is open.
     Both source paths are STROKED (no fill), so the vector keeps stroke
     attributes and a transparent fill; the grey strokes become black and the
     tint is applied at the Icon() call site from the theme (same pattern as
     ic_add_circle_outline), so it follows light/dark mode. The 25x19 glyph is
     centred in a square 25x25 viewport with a group translateY of 3 (rather
     than re-coordinating the paths), so the 24dp display keeps its true
     proportions instead of being stretched square. Path data copied verbatim. -->
